{
  "id": "1TI.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "1TI",
  "reference": "1 Timothy 2",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "First of all, then, I urge that petitions, prayers, requests, and thanksgivings be offered to God for all people; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for kings and all others who are in authority, that we may live a quiet and peaceful life with all reverence towards God and with proper conduct. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is good and it pleases God our Saviour, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who wants everyone to be saved and to come to know the truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For there is one God, and there is one who brings God and human beings together, the man Christ Jesus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who gave himself to redeem everyone. That was the proof at the right time that God wants everyone to be saved, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 1.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and that is why I was sent as an apostle and teacher of the Gentiles, to proclaim the message of faith and truth. I am not lying; I am telling the truth!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In every church service I want the men to pray, men who are dedicated to God and can lift up their hands in prayer without anger or argument. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I also want the women to be modest and sensible about their clothes and to dress properly; not with fancy hair styles or with gold ornaments or pearls or expensive dresses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but with good deeds, as is proper for women who claim to be religious. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Women should learn in silence and all humility. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I do not allow them to teach or to have authority over men; they must keep quiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 2.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.21+GEN.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21–22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Adam was created first, and then Eve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.1+GEN.3.2+GEN.3.3+GEN.3.4+GEN.3.5+GEN.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 3.1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it was not Adam who was deceived; it was the woman who was deceived and broke God's law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But a woman will be saved through having children,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "will be saved through having children",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "will be kept safe through childbirth.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " if she perseveres",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "if she perseveres",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "if they persevere.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in faith and love and holiness, with modesty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
